cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "artesian: browser-based demos of Python models, with no server"
abstract: >-
  Compiles a Python model and a Panel interface into a self-contained
  WebAssembly application that runs entirely in the reader's browser via
  Pyodide, as a Sphinx extension, a library, or a command-line tool.
type: software
authors:
